    <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">95</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">投资设立</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"left\">贵州茅台集团财务有限公司</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"right\">2, 500, 000, 000. 00</td>\n            <td class=\"center\">贵州仁怀</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">51</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">投资设立</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"left\">贵州茅台酱香酒营销有限公司</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"right\">200, 000, 000. 00</td>\n            <td class=\"center\">贵州仁怀</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">100</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">投资设立</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"left\">北京友谊使者商贸有限公司</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"right\">30, 000, 000. 00</td>\n            <td class=\"center\">北京</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">70</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">投资设立</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"left\">贵州茅台酒巴黎贸易有限公司</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"right\">80, 728, 429. 80</td>\n            <td class=\"center\">法国巴黎</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">100</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">投资设立</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"left\">贵州赖茅酒业有限公司</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"right\">40, 000, 000. 00</td>\n            <td class=\"center\">贵州贵阳</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">43</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"center\">投资设立</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <p class=\"explanation\">持有半数或以下表决权但仍控制被投资单位、以及持有半数以上表决权但不控制被投资单位的依据：</p>\n      <p class=\"indented\">公司持有贵州赖茅酒业有限公司 43%的股权比例，